The picture appears on the laptop.
My mother is there.
My father is also there.
They smile.
I am also happy.
I say, "Hello Mother!"
"How are you?"
Mother says, "I am fine."
I ask my father, "Father, how are you?"
Father smiles.
He says, "I am fine."
I am very excited.
I turn my laptop around.
"Look!"
"This is my room," I say.
"Here is one big window."
"There is one table."
Mother asks, "What is that?"
"That is my new bag."
"Its colour is blue," I say.
